<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>By the spirit I can walk,</l><l>Spiritual in spirit be;</l><l>By the spirit I can serve,</l><l>And in spirit worship Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thru Thy Word and by my prayer</l><l>In the spirit touching Thee,</l><l>Lifted high my spirit is,</l><l>Strengthened shall my spirit be.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Make my spirit strong I pray</l><l>Others’ spirits to revive;</l><l>Lift my spirit high and free,</l><l>Others’ spirits then may thrive.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Every time I speak, O Lord,</l><l>May my spirit actuate;</l><l>And whatever I may do,</l><l>Let my spirit motivate.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Every time my spirit acts</l><l>Others’ spirits opened be,</l><l>Every time my spirit moves</l><l>Others’ lifted unto Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>Lord, have mercy, from above</l><l>May Thy Spirit breathe on me;</l><l>Then my spirit will be rich,</l><l>Strengthened and refreshed by Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
